  "reasoning": "The defendant, as the legal representative of a company, deliberately avoided paying the wages of 51 employees, amounting to 378,912 RMB, despite a government order to pay. This conduct matches the statutory offense of refusing to pay labor remuneration (拒不支付劳动报酬). No other criminal conduct such as fraud, embezzlement, or illegal public deposits is described. Therefore, the appropriate charge is a single count of 拒不支付劳动报酬.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]拒不支付劳动报酬<eoa>"
